 "abstract": "The DAO will be insolvent if the value of the DAO becomes negative - in other words, if the Present Value (PV) of expected cash flows from new policies is less than the expected cash outflow from currently outstanding (old) policies. If the DAO is insolvent, the value of a token will be negative.",
